[{"title":"偶成四首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"文何为小技，理有未全明。\n妙在无夸靡，悠然写性情。\n勺泉常澹泊，五味总调成。\n垂老方知此，讥予必后生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成四首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"八珍罗水陆，五采绣文章。\n美矣孰无好，用之非可常。\n古今天地运，昼夜日星光。\n何必惊人眼，相看共久长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成四首 其三","author":"陶安","text":"清河追钴鉧，老牧步潮州。\n全气有虞子，馀风挹静修。\n居然成典雅，正不在雕锼。\n更有神交处，渊源溯鲁邹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成四首 其四","author":"陶安","text":"博学草庐翁，还存荆陆风。\n欧黄皆后出，绳墨是良工。\n南土文华盛，中州景慕同。\n九原不可作，我亦老江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月二日晟生朝赋诗","author":"陶安","text":"上巳前一日，生辰愿百龄。\n乾坤幸赋质，昼夜必研经。\n戴礼承高躅，韩文挹远馨。\n分阴尤可惜，修业寄幽庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪一初归淳安二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"地虽邻险要，天独厚仁贤。\n兵革十年久，祖孙三世全。\n雀桥云出水，雉岭雨肥田。\n已遂南归计，令人一黯然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪一初归淳安二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"继粟养君子，倚闾烦老亲。\n家山频入梦，泮水再逢春。\n人傍绿阴去，沙明锦色新。\n清名留省闼，时至道还伸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林彦明回括兼简刘伯温胡仲渊二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"为客二千里，离家五六年。\n词垣开省掖，宾席拥楼船。\n巢水栽花地，苍山种粟田。\n归心何浩荡，执手重留连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林彦明回括兼简刘伯温胡仲渊二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"伯也温如玉，仲兮清比渊。\n悬知佳会近，烦以远音传。\n同郡成三杰，怀人共一天。\n赞兴邦国业，幸有主君贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭胡通甫参政","author":"陶安","text":"步战劳江北，仁声诵浙东。\n妖兵生肘腋，行路尽哀恫。\n列祀忠臣庙，无惭古将风。\n青油戎幕在，虎旅气仍雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭王用和郎中","author":"陶安","text":"苗顽迷逆顺，草窃陷忠贤。\n寂寞金华省，凋零绿水莲。\n有儿同死难，无路得生旋。\n建业南城外，伤心指墓田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦斋二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"先生于此乐，举世最难堪。\n坚守心无变，方知味转甘。\n檗皮冰共嚼，熊胆剂能谙。\n大任从天降，勤劬弃宴酣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦斋二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"襄阳有高节，涑水更清修。\n愈病思良药，劳生遂远猷。\n匏瓜缘筱架，橄榄共茶瓯。\n见说斋中叟，年来蔗境游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薇","author":"陶安","text":"敢依华省地，未结玉堂邻。\n树石借馀韵，夏秋常一春。\n故添荒境丽，似掩老夫贫。\n时物还迁变，临风感慨新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自适","author":"陶安","text":"艾炷乾尤焫，蓍茎老益神。\n病多疏世故，欲寡乐吾真。\n秋祀邻赊酒，晨炊婢析薪。\n掩书休目力，枸杞荐茶新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"习静","author":"陶安","text":"双闼晓来辟，一天秋气清。\n雨溪分砚水，风木厌瓢声。\n习静调冲气，耽书老此生。\n上官询近候，片语对真情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自乐","author":"陶安","text":"广大者天地，中间着此身。\n道从无意得，心与太初邻。\n咽息灵龟饱，随时尺蠖伸。\n步行驺从远，林叟或相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远意","author":"陶安","text":"谁谓羲农古，朝朝眼底人。\n青天不改色，沧海几扬尘。\n静看松梢月，孤吟石洞春。\n年馀不饮酒，掬水味偏淳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄孔佥宪二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"骢马出门早，天清霜满林。\n有官簪白笔，无欲贱黄金。\n爱此双溪月，知人一寸心。\n同僚得佳士，来听杏坛琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄孔佥宪二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"元凯春秋癖，愚溪钴鉧游。\n遗文照千古，之子逼前修。\n别久思刮目，忧来独倚楼。\n倚楼人不见，江雨雁声秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄人二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"灯照秋蛩壁，帷开白鹭车。\n溪山远天末，消息近来疏。\n慷慨安边策，公平考绩书。\n郊行勤问俗，欢意动茅庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄人二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"暇日费吟思，新霜添鬓华。\n还期大雅作，颇厌晚唐葩。\n未雪梅千树，才晴月满家。\n登楼寻八咏，应笑昔人誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题清高亭","author":"陶安","text":"不受尘所浊，应无物与齐。\n一天秋月爽，千嶂晓云低。\n汲水瓢堪饮，乘风杖独跻。\n超然胸次远，境胜畅幽栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜归","author":"陶安","text":"黄昏出华省，禁鼓起高城。\n孀妇邻西泣，栖乌枝上惊。\n一窗疏雨响，半夜薄寒生。\n感客不成寐，凄风厩马鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙湾舟师二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"江水西南急，楼船十丈高。\n英王今自将，甲士气俱豪。\n天阔云帆展，龙光掣宝刀。\n缤纷过鹦鹉，呼吸息鲸涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙湾舟师二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"周郎战赤壁，楚羽刎乌江。\n江汉为南纪，相将入大邦。\n龙骧迷雪浪，翼以万艂艭。\n士马环城处，婴儿系组降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凤池","author":"陶安","text":"秋冷凤池波，凭栏照影皤。\n乾坤渺无际，老觉此身多。\n霜雪浮青壁，江湖梦绿蓑。\n干戈何日罢，玉烛四时和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸卯九月二十一日作","author":"陶安","text":"立冬前一日，雷电蛰虫惊。\n雨气蒸人暖，潮头触岸平。\n君王敬天变，宰相访民生。\n穫稻筑场圃，千村正望晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬","author":"陶安","text":"乍寒冬气应，此日电雷收。\n风力生东北，天兵溯上流。\n忆君亲沐雨，愧我已重裘。\n只待青天霁，聊宽下土忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀友","author":"陶安","text":"霜月清无际，溪山翠满庭。\n英风击蛇笏，标致换鹅经。\n一自东南去，千岩草木青。\n知心人渺渺，添我鬓星星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"霜露","author":"陶安","text":"霜露应时降，年年生客愁。\n长怀旧茔域，不得省松楸。\n落日青山远，凄风老涕流。\n萦心皆国事，无暇为身谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬初","author":"陶安","text":"木落山多石，霜严水不潮。\n一时何凛凛，两鬓易萧萧。\n惊鹊巢难稳，冥鸿路已遥。\n街头新炭贵，冷室意无聊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜","author":"陶安","text":"书几残灯在，房栊清夜徂。\n高鸿叫云冷，明月照人孤。\n银箭遥传漏，红金不到炉。\n拥衾才瞑目，飞梦满江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"免咎","author":"陶安","text":"旧帙丹黄昧，新齑碧绿淹。\n藉茅期免咎，咽李恐伤廉。\n病退仍求药，神清少食盐。\n每逢同志语，相勉律身严。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"释疑","author":"陶安","text":"人喜闻人过，我唯攻我疵。\n狐冰疑自释，鱼水乐相知。\n官府新文积，边城远檄驰。\n长沙言切直，前汉赖扶持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣愁","author":"陶安","text":"默守此心定，仰看孤月明。\n忧来多为国，老去岂偷生。\n将校乘时奋，乾坤有日清。\n新霜寒太骤，旧絮晓来轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄钱彦良二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"垆亭旧时月，两地照分离。\n岁久无音信，人来每问知。\n蟂矶息烽火，鸥渚净涟漪。\n县郭茅茨密，遗民喜得师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄潘章甫二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"总角真英物，回头已壮龄。\n文生新句语，动合旧仪刑。\n腊雪松梅在，朝槃菽粟馨。\n圣模勤玩索，吾老重叮咛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄示从子旻二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"旧居数椽屋，昔别八经霜。\n兵后琴书少，城南畎亩荒。\n家传存朴素，兄老喜安康。\n久病吾衰矣，唯期汝自强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄示从子旻二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"东郭多佳阜，西风息战尘。\n故家丘陇在，经乱树为薪。\n岁久羁人远，霜寒节序新。\n无由亲拜扫，怅望泪沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄示马甥希穆","author":"陶安","text":"昔当童冠日，从我久留连。\n转首二十载，游心先后天。\n别来疏戚里，怅望旧山川。\n遥想寒窗夜，耽书不爱眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈一飞","author":"陶安","text":"月朗荷花屋，秋香桂子林。\n相违三隔岁，未得一论心。\n巾笥应藏藁，书籯不贮金。\n欲思黄鹄举，当惜白驹阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省中夜直","author":"陶安","text":"长廊群掾散，从者煮茶供。\n寒雨连深夜，清灯照瘦容。\n明生白雪壁，响度顺风钟。\n松火炉中烬，神清睡不浓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读易","author":"陶安","text":"理自无形著，辞因有象陈。\n冰霜寒闭野，天地暗回春。\n位衍生生数，蓍存七七神。\n吾心如吻合，何物不弥纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿墉二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"阿墉方四岁，学诵五言诗。\n头耸骨如角，情钟翁所奇。\n候门迎马到，哭妹感人思。\n夜夜灯前看，宽怀有此儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿墉二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"时时思祖母，啼向素帏前。\n近者吾衰甚，闻之涕泫然。\n一心期汝长，八世嗣家传。\n幸有书巢在，成才望老天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与员外黄观澜李彦章试士西掖","author":"陶安","text":"王业兴家国，人才荐庙堂。\n风帘留晷刻，冰鉴照毫芒。\n列坐清仪肃，终篇耿论昌。\n愿言登用者，一一是贤良。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬暖","author":"陶安","text":"贫室无衣褐，常忧雪霰零。\n天心怜赤子，日色盎玄冥。\n耰麦便温土，观梅立小亭。\n北山如媚客，聊可敞疏棂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪志","author":"陶安","text":"读易四十载，玩心毫发间。\n追寻千古派，流入五夫山。\n述旨情徒切，劳生事不闲。\n斯文天若佐，暂免缀朝班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野叟二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"作史居官府，休心类野翁。\n不将文胜质，独与古同风。\n将相咨询后，山林梦寐中。\n此身虽案牍，幽趣满帘栊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野叟二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"避世潜山野，输君隐市朝。\n行年今欲老，太朴未全消。\n竹屋观晴嶂，茶铛煮午潮。\n献芹心正切，未得友鱼樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸卯仲冬望日登舟秦淮翌旦过龙湾出大江","author":"陶安","text":"舟发秦淮暮，西风正面来。\n朝从大江溯，风转两帆开。\n白鸟晴逾洁，黄芦冷未摧。\n潮平行正稳，几度见烽台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚过三山","author":"陶安","text":"寒江浸天影，暮色接苍茫。\n帆落波迎棹，船虚月到床。\n断矶成豕突，平渚衍蛇长。\n黄帽齐宣力，知吾去意忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烈山","author":"陶安","text":"空明无所有，何物抗吾篙。\n地底云根涌，波心贝阙高。\n四时萦草木，千古任风涛。\n挺立不摇荡，居然一俊髦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"橹港","author":"陶安","text":"昔年游此地，市井簇人烟。\n水驿官船鼓，花林酒閤弦。\n重来尽芦渚，何异变桑田。\n回望蟂矶在，临流独怅然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"繁昌","author":"陶安","text":"午过繁昌邑，山鸡语近郊。\n战场枯白骨，行径老黄茅。\n官廨新临水，人家类结巢。\n凤凰山独好，寒翠动吟嘲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"板子矶","author":"陶安","text":"山连阵云势，飞出大江干。\n乱石纹如斲，双峦影共寒。\n蟾蜍伴清夜，龙口束惊湍。\n爱此琼瑶窟，持杯子细看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荻港","author":"陶安","text":"空垣霜藓湿，鸡犬四无闻。\n怪树作人立，断碑经火焚。\n沟鱼争雪水，山鸟哢朝昕。\n信步不知处，风林樵运斤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石窝","author":"陶安","text":"飞峦立万石，正面俯清波。\n心喜到佳处，吾将营此窝。\n江芜烟浩荡，野竹雪婆娑。\n冻鹱相看久，忘机意共多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁家洲","author":"陶安","text":"季世轻边备，奸臣岂将才。\n妖金声动地，炎火冷如灰。\n营垒已陈迹，山川犹壮哉。\n水流呜咽处，过客每兴哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"管生时顺昔从予学今为历官同舟西上","author":"陶安","text":"牺图窥圣秘，凤历授人时。\n大礼占新岁，同行逊旧师。\n烟尘千里净，桑梓寸心思。\n西谒军门后，舒州访故知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜陵二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"县市无城堵，坡陀枕水滨。\n铜坑寒凿矿，炭户晓担薪。\n兵后姜芽少，岩深箭竹新。\n沙蹊浮石子，戛戛履声频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32413,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜陵二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"石塔深巢鸟，砖街曲类蛇。\n平山立烽堠，小港隐渔槎。\n田废多生荻，池湮不沤麻。\n独存荒鬼殿，未有县官衙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32414,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过铜陵述事","author":"陶安","text":"偶见绿衣使，询知绣斧翁。\n登程先数日，何事滞孤蓬。\n遥想观秋浦，高吟醉晚风。\n快须牵百丈，追逐与相同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32415,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过池阳","author":"陶安","text":"一钱有华胄，三载守名邦。\n我偶经秋浦，无由共夜窗。\n烟云浮短树，雪月照空江。\n倚棹西南去，应惭过雁双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32416,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题池口驿","author":"陶安","text":"孤帆向江汉，四野息风尘。\n忽见满山雪，因之怀故人。\n沧波遥注海，冻树暗藏春。\n他日重来处，桑麻雨露新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32417,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入彭泽境","author":"陶安","text":"叠嶂起当路，江从何处来。\n树梢山庙出，草罅石门开。\n浅浪分流港，高空望远台。\n唯因陶令后，此境尽佳哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32418,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蕲州道中","author":"陶安","text":"南来冬不冷，山水一春台。\n未落千林木，新开几树梅。\n矶侵江面狭，浪击岸沙摧。\n驿路二千里，兹行亦壮哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32419,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"使客","author":"陶安","text":"平生有诗史，行藁出巾箱。\n使客皆千里，官船共一觞。\n高云飞鹳鹤，微雨湿衣裳。\n夜静未能睡，清谈对烛光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过道士洑㈠","author":"陶安","text":"据床梳短发，飞雾湿征袍。\n石触回流急，云栖密树高。\n买鱼供早膳，服药出陈醪。\n惜不乘风力，吾行亦甚劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊沙口","author":"陶安","text":"漠漠寒云野，垂垂暮雨天。\n苍湾龙尾掉，紫石马肝悬。\n击火炊陈米，分盐换小鲜。\n疾风从震荡，终夜自安眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]